    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/905540/extras/765c7e491ca31627df934a9e02422915.poster.avif?t=1726106706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/905540/extras/765c7e491ca31627df934a9e02422915.webm?t=1726106706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/905540/extras/765c7e491ca31627df934a9e02422915.mp4?t=1726106706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>FRIGID IS A SURVIVAL EXPLORATION EXPERIENCE</strong><br>Frigid is an exploration-survival game inspired by The Thing movies. Set in the Canadian arctic region where a cataclysmic event puts you in a desperate fight to survive nature. Climate researchers studying the contamination of arctic glaciers have found something disturbing in the area. Your job is to find help, figure out what they found, and survive the ordeal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>SURVIVAL EXPLORATION SANDBOX WORLDS</strong><br></li><li><strong>SCAVENGE, CRAFT, BUILD ITEMS TAILORED TO ARCTIC EXPERIENCE</strong><br></li><li><strong>SINGLE PLAYER CAMPAIGN INTRIGUING STORY WITH EMOTIONAL SURVIVORS</strong><br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL MECHANICS/CRAFTING</h2><strong>Scavenge</strong> anything you can find to aid your survival. Use your creativity to put together and <strong>Craft</strong> unique items tailored to the brutal arctic environment and <strong>Build</strong> tools, weapons, and shelter to navigate, hunt, and provide protection against these challenging temperatures. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/905540/extras/4ef80d35f9cfeb68ff0c3204750b3225.poster.avif?t=1726106706\" ><source src=\"https